WEBVTT

00:00:01.548 --> 00:00:03.778
-Yay! Yay!
-Hey, Sugar.

00:00:04.517 --> 00:00:06.007
-Ow!
-Take that!

00:00:09.989 --> 00:00:13.426
It's amazing. You seem
to be all better now.

00:00:13.426 --> 00:00:15.428
Huh? Uh, yeah.

00:00:15.428 --> 00:00:18.864
I'm fine! That silly thing
wasn't a sickness.

00:00:20.166 --> 00:00:21.861
That's true.

00:00:22.202 --> 00:00:24.727
But still, Saga.
How come?

00:00:25.738 --> 00:00:28.536
How come you
got better, too?

00:00:28.908 --> 00:00:30.899
Because you got better.

00:00:43.623 --> 00:00:46.421
I won't leave you
alone again, ok?

00:00:48.695 --> 00:00:52.365
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:52.365 --> 00:00:55.368
On my lips,

00:00:55.368 --> 00:01:00.237
The rouge of tears.

00:01:19.959 --> 00:01:23.496
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:23.496 --> 00:01:30.902
I don't want to know
such a thing as love.

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:37.844
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:37.844 --> 00:01:40.980
On my lips,

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:44.472
The rouge of tears.

00:01:48.755 --> 00:01:52.425
On Thursdays

00:01:52.425 --> 00:01:55.395
I buy roses and...

00:01:55.395 --> 00:01:59.661
add a letter.

00:02:03.236 --> 00:02:06.906
Sugar Baby Love

00:02:06.906 --> 00:02:09.709
When I see you
in my dreams,

00:02:09.709 --> 00:02:15.079
you're so caring.

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:21.114
Huh?

00:02:21.654 --> 00:02:25.283
I said, get ready. We'll be
late for my part-time job.

00:02:26.626 --> 00:02:29.754
Are you sure? Is it ok
for me to help you?

00:02:31.864 --> 00:02:32.728
Let's go.

00:02:32.999 --> 00:02:34.489
Waffo!

00:02:36.169 --> 00:02:37.830
I love you, Saga!

00:02:39.672 --> 00:02:41.841
Today I'm going to
work until closing,

00:02:41.841 --> 00:02:44.077
but I'll be home
in time for supper.

00:02:44.077 --> 00:02:46.045
Don't work too hard, ok?

00:02:46.045 --> 00:02:48.878
Ok, ok.
Well, see you later!

00:02:59.826 --> 00:03:02.562
Finally it looks like they're
both back to normal.

00:03:02.562 --> 00:03:04.359
We shall see...

00:03:34.594 --> 00:03:36.755
Well, we're going now, Greta.

00:03:36.863 --> 00:03:39.932
See you later,
Father, Mother.

00:03:39.932 --> 00:03:42.068
We have a bit of shopping
to do on the way home.

00:03:42.068 --> 00:03:44.437
But we'll be home
as soon as we can.

00:03:44.437 --> 00:03:47.306
Oh, don't worry!
Please take your time.

00:03:47.306 --> 00:03:50.810
We can't take our time
with you at home alone.

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:52.675
You'll see. We'll be home
before you know it.

00:03:52.779 --> 00:03:54.440
Well, we're going.

00:04:21.074 --> 00:04:23.338
Ok, now is our chance!

00:04:27.847 --> 00:04:31.517
Very well. We will now commence
"Operation Move Saga's Piano."

00:04:31.517 --> 00:04:32.506
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

00:04:33.319 --> 00:04:36.355
We will move it from the courtyard
to the alleyway in one fell swoop.

00:04:36.355 --> 00:04:40.416
From there, we will take the route to Saga's
house that we decided yesterday. Ok?

00:04:40.526 --> 00:04:44.931
Oh, this is kind of exciting.
Saga will be surprised for sure!

00:04:44.931 --> 00:04:45.989
Yeah.

00:04:46.099 --> 00:04:49.432
Wait a minute.
I haven't been told any of this.

00:04:49.635 --> 00:04:54.006
How do you intend to transport the piano
to Saga's house without attracting attention?

00:04:54.006 --> 00:04:55.808
You have nothing to fear.

00:04:55.808 --> 00:04:57.977
I've taken care
of everything.

00:04:57.977 --> 00:04:59.569
Leave it to good ol' Phil!

00:05:13.092 --> 00:05:17.256
What do you think of the genius of
Phil's great invention, Robotchi #2?

00:05:18.164 --> 00:05:22.191
What do you mean, "great invention"?
This robot is disgraceful.

00:05:22.735 --> 00:05:26.405
The point is to conceal that we
are transporting a piano, right?

00:05:26.405 --> 00:05:28.635
It's camouflage.
Camouflage.

00:05:29.475 --> 00:05:32.044
Phil.
Stop talking and help.

00:05:32.044 --> 00:05:34.080
This is hard to
do by ourselves.

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:35.104
Oh, sorry.

00:05:35.681 --> 00:05:38.451
So, you push good
and hard, too, Greta.

00:05:38.451 --> 00:05:42.114
Just a minute. Make sure
that you handle it carefully.

00:05:42.255 --> 00:05:44.780
Hard to port!

00:05:44.891 --> 00:05:46.449
Hey, in there!

00:05:46.559 --> 00:05:48.220
Hey! Are you
listening to me!

00:05:49.495 --> 00:05:52.089
Handle it carefully. It's made
of cardboard, you know.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:03.532
I'm sorry, Mr. Luchino!
I wasn't paying attention.

00:06:05.545 --> 00:06:07.536
I-I'm sorry, Saga.

00:06:08.314 --> 00:06:10.305
It's ok.
Don't worry about it.

00:06:11.184 --> 00:06:13.175
Aren't you going
to get mad?

00:06:14.287 --> 00:06:16.517
Do you want
me to get mad?

00:06:16.622 --> 00:06:20.459
I'll keep trying!
I'll keep trying to help you!

00:06:20.459 --> 00:06:23.229
Ok, then maybe I'll
get you to wash this.

00:06:23.229 --> 00:06:24.628
Ok!

00:06:27.934 --> 00:06:29.969
Hey, Saga?

00:06:29.969 --> 00:06:31.800
I wonder when the
piano will come back.

00:06:32.805 --> 00:06:34.033
What?

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:39.840
You'll work hard. I'll work hard. And
then your piano will come back, right?

00:06:41.247 --> 00:06:46.446
Once the piano is back, I'm going
to play your mommy's song with you.

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:50.853
Yeah. I forgot.

00:06:53.826 --> 00:06:55.494
Huh? What's that?

00:06:55.494 --> 00:06:56.262
-Huh?

00:06:56.262 --> 00:06:56.660
-Huh?
-Huh?

00:07:00.066 --> 00:07:02.235
Honestly, how pathetic.

00:07:02.235 --> 00:07:05.071
Can't this heap even
turn a corner properly?

00:07:05.071 --> 00:07:07.240
It happened because
you won't help push.

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:10.443
Oh, my. Are you going to blame
others for your own mistakes?

00:07:10.443 --> 00:07:12.278
And you call yourself a man?

00:07:12.278 --> 00:07:14.337
What are you guys doing?

00:07:16.148 --> 00:07:18.718
Saga! Uh, no, this is...

00:07:18.718 --> 00:07:20.481
Phil, are you at it again?

00:07:20.987 --> 00:07:22.622
-I'm sorry, Mr. Luchino.

00:07:22.622 --> 00:07:23.987
-I'm sorry, Mr. Luchino.
-Okey-dokey!

00:07:28.527 --> 00:07:30.229
-What is it?
-N-Nothing.

00:07:30.229 --> 00:07:33.065
-It's ok, Saga.
-We can handle this by ourselves.

00:07:33.065 --> 00:07:34.930
Yeah, but look at it.

00:07:38.504 --> 00:07:41.107
Saga! Saga! Hey, Saga!

00:07:41.107 --> 00:07:42.074
What's wrong?

00:07:42.074 --> 00:07:44.944
Oh, my!
There's nothing wrong.

00:07:44.944 --> 00:07:46.112
Just a minute, Greta!

00:07:46.112 --> 00:07:49.415
What is this? Aren't you
supposed to be working?

00:07:49.415 --> 00:07:52.118
You should return to
the store immediately.

00:07:52.118 --> 00:07:55.019
I'm saying that if you leave
something this big here...

00:07:55.321 --> 00:07:59.519
Saga! Inside! Inside the robot,
there's the pi-pi-pi...

00:08:02.795 --> 00:08:05.059
There you go.
It's ok now.

00:08:07.867 --> 00:08:11.530
No, Mr. Luchino! I have to be
inside at the controls first!

00:08:13.506 --> 00:08:15.940
Hey, wait right there!

00:08:18.878 --> 00:08:20.140
I got it!

00:08:21.714 --> 00:08:23.579
What?
No way! No!

00:08:24.483 --> 00:08:27.975
Oh, no! Don't do that!

00:08:30.589 --> 00:08:32.147
Ahh!

00:08:36.195 --> 00:08:37.685
Uh-oh.

00:08:39.665 --> 00:08:42.156
Don't just stand there,
Saga! Help out!

00:08:52.645 --> 00:08:54.135
What's going on?

00:08:55.181 --> 00:08:56.842
What's this about?

00:09:00.453 --> 00:09:03.789
Somebody help me!

00:09:03.789 --> 00:09:06.519
Saga's mother's piano!

00:09:24.176 --> 00:09:25.244
-Hi, Sugar.

00:09:25.244 --> 00:09:26.779
-Hi, Sugar.
-What'cha doing?

00:09:26.779 --> 00:09:28.481
Basil! Cinnamon!

00:09:28.481 --> 00:09:31.314
The piano!
Stop Saga's piano!

00:09:32.718 --> 00:09:34.954
You want to
stop this thing?

00:09:34.954 --> 00:09:36.251
Ok, leave it to us.

00:10:11.524 --> 00:10:12.320
Huh?

00:10:16.228 --> 00:10:18.196
You have got to be kidding.

00:10:26.205 --> 00:10:27.866
Excuse me!
Coming through!

00:10:28.707 --> 00:10:33.804
No! Father!

00:10:36.482 --> 00:10:41.647
No! Why?
At a time like this!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.280
What?

00:10:55.334 --> 00:10:58.360
What on earth is going on?

00:11:08.714 --> 00:11:11.774
No!

00:11:14.954 --> 00:11:19.414
Stop me!
Somebody stop me!

00:11:21.594 --> 00:11:25.257
Somebody! Somebody
please stop the piano!

00:11:32.204 --> 00:11:35.503
-Did you see it?
-No. I'll try there next.

00:11:36.509 --> 00:11:37.806
Wait.

00:11:43.482 --> 00:11:45.882
There it is.
Let's go, Alan!

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:49.811
N-Nooo!

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:13.201
No!!

00:12:15.314 --> 00:12:16.949
No! No!

00:12:16.949 --> 00:12:20.282
No! No!
Stand back! Stand back!

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:26.781
Somebody, help!

00:12:32.531 --> 00:12:34.999
I'm sure Greta
will be surprised.

00:12:35.834 --> 00:12:38.704
Yes, she didn't seem to
take a liking to the piano.

00:12:38.704 --> 00:12:42.196
So, if we buy her this many
presents, she's bound to like one.

00:12:52.217 --> 00:12:53.878
Greta!

00:12:56.488 --> 00:12:58.357
E-Excuse me!

00:12:58.357 --> 00:13:00.757
The piano!
Please go after that piano!

00:13:02.828 --> 00:13:05.558
-Saga, have you seen it?
-Huh? N-No.

00:13:05.998 --> 00:13:07.761
That isn't much help.

00:13:07.933 --> 00:13:10.369
-It went that way!
-No, that way!

00:13:10.369 --> 00:13:11.236
-Let's go!

00:13:11.236 --> 00:13:12.760
-Let's go!
-Uh, wait a minute!

00:13:12.838 --> 00:13:15.608
-That way!
-Ooh, I said wait!

00:13:15.608 --> 00:13:17.109
What is it?

00:13:17.109 --> 00:13:21.205
Don't be impatient with me!
Explain to me how this happened!

00:13:21.313 --> 00:13:25.417
I'll explain that later. Don't you
care what happens to the piano!

00:13:25.417 --> 00:13:29.183
I'm asking you how the piano got
in such a mess in the first place!

00:13:30.255 --> 00:13:32.416
It's Greta. Greta.

00:13:32.558 --> 00:13:34.426
She wanted to return
the piano to you.

00:13:34.426 --> 00:13:38.487
That's why we were trying
to deliver it to your house.

00:13:43.469 --> 00:13:46.472
Greta? You were...
Why?

00:13:46.472 --> 00:13:49.464
Well, you've been
acting strange lately.

00:13:50.409 --> 00:13:54.546
You acted like you'd forgotten your
friends, and you did nothing but work.

00:13:54.546 --> 00:13:56.946
Ever since Greta's birthday...

00:13:59.952 --> 00:14:02.045
Uh, I didn't mean...

00:14:02.321 --> 00:14:05.188
Saga, you've been doing
nothing but work recently.

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:08.460
You're going to make yourself sick.
That's why Norma's worried.

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:09.358
I don't need your worry!

00:14:09.828 --> 00:14:12.353
You are no longer the girl
I accepted as my rival!

00:14:18.904 --> 00:14:21.236
We've all been
worried about you.

00:14:22.274 --> 00:14:24.868
Everybody's been
worried about me?

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:29.841
Oh. Miss Saga.

00:14:30.883 --> 00:14:34.114
What are you doing over here?
Are you on a little date with Phil?

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:43.250
Faster!

00:14:45.464 --> 00:14:46.453
Teacher!

00:14:49.902 --> 00:14:52.029
Hey, Miss Saga!

00:14:52.838 --> 00:14:54.328
You guys...

00:15:00.979 --> 00:15:03.470
This is bad.
The brake lever is broken!

00:15:04.583 --> 00:15:06.752
Saga, keep us balanced!

00:15:06.752 --> 00:15:07.218
Right!

00:15:19.531 --> 00:15:20.589
Move! Move!

00:15:31.243 --> 00:15:32.938
Ok, charge!

00:15:33.245 --> 00:15:38.383
No! No! No!
Why does he get so stubborn

00:15:38.383 --> 00:15:40.578
at the worst
possible times?

00:15:58.904 --> 00:16:00.372
-Saved by a nut!

00:16:00.372 --> 00:16:03.205
-Saved by a nut!
-That was close, wasn't it, Sugar?

00:16:03.809 --> 00:16:05.333
Salt! Pepper!

00:16:05.577 --> 00:16:08.147
Waffo! Pepper! Pepper!

00:16:08.147 --> 00:16:09.448
Salt! Salt!

00:16:09.448 --> 00:16:12.042
Cut it out.
Cut it out.

00:16:12.151 --> 00:16:14.711
Oh, Sugar, you
haven't changed a bit.

00:16:14.853 --> 00:16:16.821
But, but...

00:16:16.922 --> 00:16:18.824
Huh? But what are
you two doing here?

00:16:18.824 --> 00:16:20.859
We'll talk later.
Let's go!

00:16:20.859 --> 00:16:21.927
Huh?

00:16:21.927 --> 00:16:24.487
You know!
We have to help Saga!

00:16:29.201 --> 00:16:31.637
Greta! I've come to save you!

00:16:31.637 --> 00:16:32.365
Father!

00:16:37.709 --> 00:16:39.199
H-Hey!

00:16:42.147 --> 00:16:43.341
Me, too!

00:16:46.852 --> 00:16:48.086
-Children!

00:16:48.086 --> 00:16:49.383
-Children!
-Dear!

00:16:58.397 --> 00:16:59.198
-Guys!

00:16:59.198 --> 00:16:59.898
-Guys!
-Saga!

00:16:59.898 --> 00:17:01.559
Miss Saga?

00:17:03.335 --> 00:17:04.269
-Saga!

00:17:04.269 --> 00:17:05.065
-Saga!
-Yeah!

00:17:17.616 --> 00:17:20.085
I challenge you, Greta.

00:17:20.085 --> 00:17:22.054
We're going to stop
the piano together.

00:17:22.054 --> 00:17:23.351
That's fine by me.

00:17:28.126 --> 00:17:30.060
Salt, Pepper!

00:17:30.162 --> 00:17:31.496
-We're here for you.

00:17:31.496 --> 00:17:33.293
-We're here for you.
-It's been a long time.

00:17:33.465 --> 00:17:35.456
Saga, we're together!

00:17:36.134 --> 00:17:38.125
We're together again!

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:39.232
Yeah!

00:17:39.972 --> 00:17:42.174
Ok, let's do it!

00:17:42.174 --> 00:17:43.835
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

00:17:44.009 --> 00:17:45.374
-Heave-ho!
-Heave-ho!

00:17:49.481 --> 00:17:51.583
What is this?
It's completely useless.

00:17:51.583 --> 00:17:55.075
I guess a store sign pole is too
weak to use as a lever, after all.

00:18:10.202 --> 00:18:10.998
My...

00:19:03.989 --> 00:19:05.223
-Sugar! Pepper!

00:19:05.223 --> 00:19:05.951
-Sugar! Pepper!
-Right!

00:19:56.541 --> 00:19:57.838
Mom?

00:20:59.504 --> 00:21:02.166
Yeah. I'll be ok now.

00:21:20.792 --> 00:21:21.359
-Greta!

00:21:21.359 --> 00:21:23.020
-Greta!
-Father! Mother!

00:21:23.228 --> 00:21:24.830
-Oh, Greta.

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:26.855
-Oh, Greta.
-I was so worried!

00:21:27.999 --> 00:21:32.026
Greta, take good
care of the piano.

00:21:32.537 --> 00:21:33.765
Miss Saga?

00:21:33.872 --> 00:21:38.443
Huh? Saga, you're
giving up the piano? Why?

00:21:38.443 --> 00:21:40.172
Because I'm ok now.

00:21:40.278 --> 00:21:41.346
Huh?

00:21:41.346 --> 00:21:43.541
Because I have you, Sugar.

00:21:43.782 --> 00:21:44.441
Huh?

00:21:44.549 --> 00:21:46.278
And I have my friends.

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:50.245
Thank you, everyone!

00:21:50.722 --> 00:21:53.892
But let me come over and
play it once in a while, ok?

00:21:53.892 --> 00:22:00.058
I like this piano, too.

00:22:20.752 --> 00:22:25.390
Wishes upon the Moon

00:22:25.390 --> 00:22:28.760
Melting in the water...

00:22:28.760 --> 00:22:34.099
I found a street
lined with trees.

00:22:34.099 --> 00:22:39.004
Songs of stardust

00:22:39.004 --> 00:22:47.412
The breeze crossing over
the Bridge of Rainbows.

00:22:47.412 --> 00:22:52.717
You already knew...

00:22:52.717 --> 00:22:57.522
The happiness of
connecting our hearts...

00:22:57.522 --> 00:22:59.691
Sugar Snow

00:22:59.691 --> 00:23:07.832
When powdery snow
whirls in town,

00:23:07.832 --> 00:23:13.071
The season of flower
blossoms is near,

00:23:13.071 --> 00:23:17.770
And I think of you...

00:23:19.578 --> 00:23:26.384
The love that melts
our hearts and

00:23:26.384 --> 00:23:35.122
The dreams are
in your heart...

00:23:39.598 --> 00:23:40.465
Preview of Next Episode

00:23:40.465 --> 00:23:42.490
Preview of Next Episode
I love your piano, Saga!

00:23:42.601 --> 00:23:48.406
I love waffles, your grandmother's stew,
naps, walks, Mr. Bear, picnics,

00:23:48.406 --> 00:23:51.109
and I even love shampoo,
as long as I'm with you!

00:23:51.109 --> 00:23:53.378
Yeah. I feel the same.

00:23:53.378 --> 00:23:57.144
Oh, no. What's wrong with you
all of a sudden? Hey, Sugar!

00:23:57.949 --> 00:24:03.088
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The Final Episode Is
"I'm Right Over Here"

00:24:03.088 --> 00:24:05.386
We'll always be together, Saga.
